 Can't wait to visit next month. Anything cool you remember about Boston parks?\n[Image caption: a photo of a tree with pink flowers in the foreground]\n[S8T5] (dia_id: D8:5)\n\nDave: That sounds great! The Boston parks are awesome, especially in spring. It's so serene when you're walking around. I went for a stroll last Friday and it was amazing. It's so magical - I bet you'll love it! I love taking walks on the weekends, they recharge me for the entire upcoming week!\n[S8T6] (dia_id: D8:6)\n\nCalvin: I'm excited to experience that serenity. I can't wait to take a walk in the parks and recharge. Hey, have you been on any hikes lately?\n[Image caption: a photo of a path going up a hill with a view of the mountains]\n[S8T7] (dia_id: D8:7)","text_sha256":"21ac4cd3d1454b7a264bac146ee51a61095139d2096990d8a6fd7607a8811a63","timestamp":"2023-06-09T14:31:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D17:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":29,"line_start":27,"source_locators":["[S17T6]"],"text_sha256":"baf8f68059bd17fd0c90b6ec79c86dfb8f3280ff4542797c2f57c414d2e6daa4"},{"dia_ids":["D17:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":32,"line_start":31,"source_locators":["[S17T7]"],"text_sha256":"56c8033a90b9beee29376254d7f55b86dab39e810fd76c9b5b2387e693c626db"}],"dia_ids":["D17:6","D17:7"],"evidence_id":"ev-af9e7ec834a115b12ad1dd36399ea472090f62e4246e788b4be21da918dccabe","group_id":"session_17","line_end":32,"line_start":27,"observation_ids":["obs-0007"],"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-17.md","query_terms":[],"rank":null,"records_sha256":"130a5a1e1b75083358ef27a98dd215a4e75c819ace6f2ee9b560ba394e0f0394","retrieval_round":6,"schema_version":1,"score":null,"section":"# Session 17","selection_ordinal":5,"session_id":"session_17","source_kind":"raw","source_locators":["[S17T6]","[S17T7]"],"source_map_sha256":"6e99115961bae06a48bfb7e82dbdcc18dc32ccf6c5ce57e3c266dfc7a5d4d574","source_records":[{"di